  "body": "Ideal 'lock up and leave' without the worry of home maintenance, this modern two bedroom, two bathroom apartment in sought after Kensington Park delivers an easy, low-maintenance lifestyle with resort-style amenities right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nLight, bright and thoughtfully designed, the home features spacious open plan living, a modern kitchen with quality finishes and a sunny balcony that captures the afternoon sun. With two secure basement carparks, a storage locker and convenient lift access, everyday living is effortless.\r\n\r\nOutside, the beautifully maintained grounds are cared for by the community gardeners, giving you more time to enjoy the things that matter, whether that's travelling, relaxing or making the most of Orewa's coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nAnd there's plenty to enjoy without even leaving home. Kensington Park residents have access to a heated indoor pool, gym, sauna, community gardens, walking trails beneath ancient pohutukawa trees, and a picturesque lake. The on-site garden café is perfect for a leisurely coffee or catch up.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned for an easy commute while offering the tranquillity of a vibrant coastal community, this is a home that gives you both comfort and freedom with the added reassurance of freehold unit title ownership.\r\n\r\nLock up. Leave. Come home. Repeat.\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser : https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/GFWV",
